{"timestamp":1774802117334,"source_app":"agentic-harness","session_id":"2204070c-6d7b-43af-8cd6-099aceb27dfc","hook_event_type":"PreToolUse","tool_name":"Write","tool_use_id":"toolu_019MN4TP6U1VECokgtMTwn4d","payload":{"session_id":"2204070c-6d7b-43af-8cd6-099aceb27dfc","transcript_path":"/Users/rivero/.claude/projects/-Users-rivero-ai-agentic-harness-apps-mas-trees-pw-35226f5c/2204070c-6d7b-43af-8cd6-099aceb27dfc.jsonl","cwd":"/Users/rivero/ai/agentic-harness/apps/mas/trees/pw-35226f5c","permission_mode":"bypassPermissions","hook_event_name":"PreToolUse","tool_name":"Write","tool_input":{"file_path":"/Users/rivero/ai/agentic-harness/apps/mas/trees/pw-35226f5c/specs/issue-8-adw-7a5b9c1d-sdlc_planner-add-pinata-gitignore.md","content":"# Plan: Add .pinata/ to .gitignore\n\n## Summary\nAdd pinata workflow runtime directories to .gitignore to prevent accidental commits of workflow artifacts while preserving committed subdirectories.\n\n## Task Description\nThe pinata workflows engine creates a `.pinata/` directory in worktrees containing both runtime artifacts that should be ignored and committed directories (`specs/`, `docs/`) that should be tracked. Need to add specific patterns to `.gitignore` to exclude runtime files while keeping committed content.\n\n## Relevant Files\n- `.gitignore` - main ignore file that needs the new patterns added\n\n## Step by Step Tasks\n\n### 1. Add pinata runtime patterns to .gitignore\n- Add `.pinata/logs/` to exclude log files (note: `**/logs/` on line 1 may already cover this)\n- Add `.pinata/reports/` to exclude report files\n- Add `.pinata/agents/` to exclude agent runtime data\n- Add `.pinata/ports.env` to exclude port configuration\n- Add `.pinata/stack.json` to exclude stack configuration\n- Group these entries together with a comment for clarity\n\n## Acceptance Criteria\n- `.gitignore` contains entries for all specified pinata runtime artifacts\n- Existing gitignore patterns remain unchanged\n- New entries are grouped logically with descriptive comment\n\n## Validation Commands\n- `git status` to verify no pinata runtime files are shown as untracked\n- `git check-ignore .pinata/logs/test.log` should return the file (if .pinata/ exists)"},"tool_use_id":"toolu_019MN4TP6U1VECokgtMTwn4d"}}
